["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"《TikTok内幕：张一鸣的巨浪征途》音频版（下集） UG PMO GDPR All-Hands Meeting\" href=\"/podcast/p/2022-05-05-zhangxiaojun-不留空档全面压制-tiktok-花-100-亿美元砸出护城河/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c3c064d7b78c0bb1-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">45:03</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0505</span></div>\n<h2>不留空档全面压制：TikTok 花 100 亿美元砸出护城河</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">TikTok 全球化的第一推力是钱和一条暗号：几年间投入约 100 亿美元买量、补贴内容、砸服务器，对手要拦至少得准备 200 到 300 亿美元。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">字节跳动</span><span class=\"tag\">TikTok</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"《TikTok内幕：张一鸣的巨浪征途》音频版（上集） ARPU Lasso\" href=\"/podcast/p/2022-04-29-zhangxiaojun-tiktok-曾是-facebook-最尊贵的客户-直到日活破亿/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/297c1019274060ab-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">35:22</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0429</span></div>\n<h2>TikTok 曾是 Facebook 最尊贵的客户，直到日活破亿</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">TikTok 早期最重要的投放渠道是 Facebook，推广预算每个季度增长 100% 以上；Facebook 认定它留存太差、留不住用户，反而把流量导给它。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">出海</span><span class=\"tag\">TikTok</span>\n</div></div></a>"]